    <string name="why_naked_pair">In %1$s, two cells can only be %2$d or %3$d. They take both, so no other cell there can.</string>
    <string name="why_hidden_pair">In %1$s, %2$d and %3$d fit only the same two cells, so those cells hold nothing else.</string>
    <string name="why_x_wing">In %1$s and %2$s, %5$d fits only where they cross %3$s and %4$s. One %5$d per line must use those corners, so the rest of %3$s and %4$s can\'t be %5$d.</string>
